          %div
            %h3#ReferencesQuantumObservableAlgebrasAsGroupoidAlgebras Quantum observable algebras as Groupoid algebras
            %p
              The original derivation of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Heisenberg+picture"} Heisenberg picture
              of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+mechanics"} quantum mechanics
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi N
                    %mo ×
                    %mi N
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N \times N
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/matrix+algebra"} matrix algebra
              for transitions between
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi N
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N
              measurable states of atomic spectra, by
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Werner+Heisenberg"}> Werner Heisenberg
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Über quantentheoretische Umdeutung kinematischer und mechanischer Beziehungen
                %strong 33
                (1925) 879–893 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01328377"}> doi:10.1007/BF01328377
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://users.mat.unimi.it/users/galgani/arch/heis25ajp.pdf"} Engl. pdf
            %p was argued by
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alain+Connes"}> Alain Connes
                , pp 43-44 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Noncommutative geometry
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://shop.elsevier.com/books/noncommutative-geometry/connes/978-0-08-057175-1"} ISBN:9780121858605
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.alainconnes.org/docs/book94bigpdf.pdf"} pdf
            %p
              to be fruitfully understood as the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoid+convolution+algebra"} groupoid convolution algebra
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pair+groupoid"} pair groupoid
              of transitions between
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi N
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N
              elements.
